6. Target architecture
6.1 User Side
services.html + js/services.js: service catalog/entry point.
pi-dapp-service.html: form, draft, required consent.
pi-dapp-policy.html: Terms, scope, exclusions, refunds/cancellation/support.
my-dapp-requests.html: list/detail/status/quote/payment/deliverables.
Dedicated JS modules su maye gurbin missing legacy references bayan an tabbatar da exact files/SHA.
A yi amfani da shared js/core/environment-core.js, js/core/supabase-core.js da js/core/pi-auth-core.js. Kada a yi LocalStorage/sessionStorage a matsayin source of truth na identity, request ko payment. Kada a canza Dock Navigation.
6.2 Trusted API
Duk write mai muhimmanci ya bi dedicated dApp-service API. Server zai tabbatar da Pi access token ta Pi Platform API, ya samo UID daga verified response, ya kulle network daga server config, ya duba owner/status/quote, ya ƙididdige amount daga database, ya rubuta audit events. Secrets ba za su shiga browser ba.
Route family da aka tsara: /api/dapp-service/… . Kada a sake amfani da Core Project financial gateway domin yana da add_liquidity-specific validation. Pi A2U payout client ba U2A checkout ba ne.
6.3 Admin Side
A cikin albukhr-admin a ƙara dedicated module mai amfani da canonical Admin Auth, roles, MFA/AAL2 da server-side authorization. Kada a ƙirƙiri parallel login/MFA ko a sake amfani da External Projects permissions kai tsaye. Admin workflow ya haɗa queue, detail, quote, payment reconciliation, status actions, deliverables da audit history.
6.4 Supabase/Storage
Supabase shi ne source of truth. Public service data zai kasance Mainnet Supabase. Kada a kwafe production requests/payments/receipts zuwa Testnet. Receipt/documents su yi amfani da private bucket na musamman idan an amince; kada a sake amfani da external-project-documents bucket ba tare da security review ba.
