9. Request lifecycle
draft → submitted → under_review
under_review → needs_information / revision_requested / approved / rejected
approved → awaiting_quote_acceptance ko awaiting_payment, bisa business rules.
Quote accepted + payment confirmed idan ana buƙatar biya → queued → in_progress → delivered → completed.
rejected/cancelled su buƙaci reason da actor. refund_requested/refund_pending/refunded su kasance payment states dabam idan policy ta amince.
Server ne kaɗai zai aiwatar da state transitions. Kowane transition yana da allow-list, role, reason idan ya dace da audit event. Approved ≠ paid; paid ≠ delivered. Idempotency/atomic DB transitions su hana double-submit/double-confirm.
10. Quote, pricing da change control
Admin-managed catalog zai bayyana active service types.
