A adana quote snapshot; canjin price na gaba ba zai canza tsohon quote ba.
Out-of-scope work ya zama change request da sabon quote.
A fayyace ko Pi amount fixed ne ko ana lissafa shi daga NGN quote bisa rule da aka amince da ita; kada a ɗauka ₦ da Pi suna daidai.
