11. Payment contracts
11.1 Bank transfer
Admin ya ƙirƙiri bank destination draft; verified + approved config kaɗai zai iya zama active.
A fi so maker-checker: wanda ya ƙirƙiri/gyara destination ba shi kaɗai zai kunna shi ba.
Idan babu verified active config, API ta dawo bank_transfer_available=false.
Server ya ƙirƙiri intent daga quote; amount/currency/destination snapshot ba su fito daga browser ba.
Receipt/reference yana sa payment ya shiga submitted_for_review kawai.
Authorized verifier ya tabbatar da reference, amount, currency, date, destination da sahihin bank source kafin confirmed.
Unique references da atomic reconciliation su hana transfer guda tabbatar da requests biyu.
11.2 Pi U2A payment
Pi SDK na frontend zai fara createPayment; backend zai yi server-side approval da completion.
Backend ya tabbatar da payment ID, owner UID, app/network, amount, metadata, request/quote linkage da provider status.
Client callback ko txid daga browser ba ya tabbatar da settlement shi kaɗai.
Approve/complete retries su zama idempotent; incomplete/cancelled/failed ba confirmed ba ne.
Server API Key a backend secrets kawai. A2U payout tooling ba U2A checkout ba ne.
Kada a sake amfani da Core Project financial gateway domin add_liquidity semantics.
Ainihin Pi API contract za a sake tabbatar da shi kafin coding. Official Pi docs sun bayyana backend verification na GET /me da server-side approval/completion na U2A payments; Server API Key ba zai shiga frontend ba. Duba: https://developers.minepi.com/docs/api-reference/PlatformAPI da https://developers.minepi.com/docs/api-reference/SdkReference.
