14. Security and audit requirements
Identity daga backend verification; kada a amince da client-supplied UID, network, amount ko role.
Server-side owner checks ga requests, quotes, intents, evidence da deliverables.
RLS, SQL grants da server authorization su dace; kada a ƙara browser privileges kawai domin sauƙaƙa UI.
Private Storage, generated paths, content/signature + MIME/size validation, short-lived signed URLs.
Network daga server config; babu request-body switch da zai canza Mainnet zuwa Testnet.
Audit event ga submit, quote/acceptance, evidence, payment confirm/reject, Admin decisions, delivery, cancellation/refund.
Rate-limit upload/reconciliation; kada a log full receipts, bank details, tokens ko secrets.
Canonical Admin Auth/MFA/AAL2/roles; UI hiding ba security control ba ne.
