21. Handoff state
An karanta takardun service da aka gano, an haɗa su da findings na source/database audit, kuma an samar da wannan master document. Ba a yi GitHub edit/commit, SQL migration/write, Storage change, payment activation ko deployment ba. Mataki na gaba: kulle business decisions da API/config details, sannan a samar da exact implementation file list da patch plan.
Official Pi documentation ta bayyana backend verification na GET /me, server-side approval/completion na U2A payments, da buƙatun app registration/URL verification kafin Mainnet launch. Saboda haka ALBUKHR ba zai yi alkawarin automatic approval ko launch ba.
